@startuml SD-2a
!include ../_style.iuml
title SD-2a (Software level, CSMS billing) — Driver creates a top-up and is sent to the payment page\nPrecondition: Driver is logged in, credit account is active or in_shortfall · System view: AD-2 · State: STM-4
footer Owner: Lê Bảo Khang (WP5) · v2.0 · 01/11/2026 · names = CD-2 class diagram (billing not in code yet) · left gate = Driver App

participant "«component»\n<u>:TopUpController</u>" as TC
participant "«component»\n<u>:TopUpService</u>" as TS
participant "«port»\n<u>:VnpayAdapter</u>" as VA

[-> TC ++ : POST /billing/top-ups {amountVnd, redeemPoints}\n[HTTPS, JWT, Idempotency-Key]
TC -> TS ++ : create(driverId, dto, key)
TS -> TS : check account not closed, amount limits,\nmonthly cap, no other open top-up (BR-P22)
break a rule is not met
  TS --> TC : TopUpRejected(reason)
  [<-- TC : 409 / 422 {reason}
end
opt redeemPoints and balance ≥ 500 points
  TS -> TS : compute discountVnd from points\n(points are redeemed only when credited, SD-2b)
end
TS -> TS : save top-up, expiresAt = now + 15 min
hnote over TS : {topUp.status = pending}
TS -> VA ++ : buildPaymentUrl(topUp, amountVnd − discountVnd)
VA --> TS -- : paymentUrl (signed)
TS --> TC -- : topUpId, paymentUrl
[<-- TC -- : 201 {topUpId, paymentUrl}
note over TC, VA
  The Driver pays on the gateway page; the return URL only shows the result.
  Credit is added only by the signed payment notification (SD-2b), or by the
  status query after 15 min (SD-2d). The same Idempotency-Key returns the same top-up.
end note
@enduml
